## 🎨 CSS pour les Contrôles

```css
.joystick-base {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 50px;
    left: 50px;
    width: 120px;
    height: 120px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    border: 3px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    border-radius: 50%;
}

.joystick-stick {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    border-radius: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    transition: transform 0.1s;
}

.game-button {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 50px;
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    border: 3px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: white;
}

.btn-jump {
    right: 50px;
}

.btn-run {
    right: 130px;
}
```

